config IR_PIKO_CIR_TX
	tristate "piko consumer IR transmitter (Zaurus IrDA transceiver)"
	depends on RC_CORE && PXA25x
	help
	  Drives the Sharp Zaurus IrDA transceiver as a 38 kHz consumer
	  infrared transmitter by bit-banging its TXD pin, so the device
	  can act as a remote control. Mutually exclusive with pxaficp_ir,
	  which owns the same pin and the same transceiver.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called piko-cir-tx.
